					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Honestly, my favorite part was the outline of required equipment for the containment chamber. As a huge fan of bad old '50s/'60s scifi movies, I can confidently say that you nailed it. Thanks in particular for including the random oscilloscopes with no discernible purpose, which people often overlook in favor of the flashier Van de Graff generators and Jacob's Ladders, but which are an essential part of every B-movie science lab (mad or otherwise).</p> 
				 	]]>
